erthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2680301852.webp","tag":"惊悚","address":" 美国","years":"2021","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"本片讲述了2018年被困在泰国洞穴中的野猪青年足球队以及他们最终被救援的戏剧性故事。凭借独家访问权限和前所未见的救援镜头，这部电影讲述了洞穴潜水员的故事，他们挑战了人类潜力的极限，并成就了一个生动人心魄的英雄们赌上生命的故事。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ar2PEJaVL2Yn0_ChqntymQ?pwd=5wvy\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":347,"title":"沉默的真相","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2620780603.webp","tag":"剧情","address":" 中国大陆","years":"2020","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"人头攒动、过往喧嚣的地铁站，一名衣衫褴褛的男子及其沉重的行李箱引起安检人员的警惕。经过一番追逐，男子声称行李箱内有炸弹，旋即引起莫大骚动。等到防暴警察赶来将其制服，却发现箱子内居然蜷缩着一具尸体。被捕男子名叫张超（宁理 饰），是江潭市小有名气的律师。他起先对罪行供认不讳，但随后拿出不在场证明当庭翻供。为此，经验丰富的刑警严良（廖凡 饰）火速加入专案组。未几，《江潭晚报》女记者张晓倩收到匿名信件，寄信人声称要玩一场关系本案的九宫格游戏。一时间，案情变得扑朔迷离，而随着调查的深入，严良也发现该案居然与多年前的一起案件息息相关……\n　　本片根据紫金陈的小说《长夜难明》改编。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1NLxdFzJpOASE1rXBAjw-ZA?pwd=jyvx\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":372,"title":"我的解放日志","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2869925687.webp","tag":"剧情","address":" 韩国","years":"2022","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"住在京畿道山浦市的廉家老大廉琦贞（李艾儿 饰）、老二廉昌熙（李民基 饰）与老幺廉美贞（金智媛 饰），三个人每天都要往返首尔，早上七点就要出门，有聚餐还要赶末班车回家，他们受够了日复一日毫无变化的成年生活，决定要在平凡无奇的人生中，寻找成就感和自由。而突然来到他们家工作的神秘人具氏（孙锡久 饰），也和三姐弟一起展开了逃离当下的解放生活 。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Z-tolSHp9oWdsqvutE72RQ?pwd=bsq6\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":656,"title":"后翼弃兵","ratingNum":9,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2621201524.webp","tag":"剧情","address":" 美国","years":"2020","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"根据沃尔特·特维斯的小说改编，这个成长故事探索了天才背后真正的代价。20 世纪 50 年代末，年幼的贝丝·哈蒙（安雅·泰勒-乔伊饰）被遗弃并托付给肯塔基州的一家孤儿院。她具有惊人的国际象棋天赋，同时对政府提供给孩童的镇静剂上瘾。贝丝被自己心中的恶魔所困扰，在药物和痴迷的双重作用下，她变成了一个令人印象深刻、技艺高超且富有魅力的弃儿，并决心打破男性主导的国际象棋界建立的传统界限。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/17p3OtbvagLypC7bL0jJHdA?pwd=3wm8\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":1242,"title":"哥斯拉-1.0 ゴジラ-1.0","ratingNum":6.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 62% 剧情片\n好于 73% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2900227040.webp","tag":"第96届奥斯卡金像奖提名名单","address":" 日本","years":"2023","date":"2023-11-01(东京国际电影节)、2023-11-03(日本)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2897688099.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089060.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089136.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900094728.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089080.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900227040.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900236341.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089123.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900227060.webp\"]","descs":"影片为庆祝哥斯拉诞生70周年的纪念作品，也是东宝第30部哥斯拉大作。故事设定在二战后的日本，哥斯拉的出现仿佛要给已经变得一无所有（归0）的日本再添一击，将这个国家打到负值（负1.0）。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/15ojC3uUyhbSBpnt3SoEfjg?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"2.78\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1230,"title":"异界 Кома","ratingNum":6.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 62% 动作片\n好于 65% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2581658698.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 俄罗斯","years":"2020","date":"2020-01-30(俄罗斯)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992822.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786557.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786556.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573607898.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992825.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581658698.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2577699733.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2613737731.webp\"]","descs":"诡异奇幻的世界，充满了一切不可能。建筑师维克托（林奈·穆罕默托夫 Rinal Muchametow 饰）从沉沉的梦中醒来，仿佛失去了所有的记忆。此时此刻，房屋上下充满了霉变一般的黑斑，而黑斑就像有生命一般，时而扩张，时而退缩。维克托走出房门，来到大街，发现眼前的一切早已脱离了现实，房屋从各个角度耸立，身边的人残缺不全却行走如常。正在此时，一团如沸腾沥青般的怪物细想了他，关键时刻维克托被二男一女救下。事后从对方口中得知，服药过量或者因事故处于濒死状态的人，才会来到这片由同类们的大脑共同构建的潜意识的世界。\n　　为了生存，维克托必须想方设法激发自己潜在的能力…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/14M1ULCF3-Vgn_VYnUzg5HA?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.51\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1256,"title":"神偷军团 Army of Thieves","ratingNum":6.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 60% 动作片\n好于 63% 犯罪片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2704531909.webp","tag":"动作,犯罪","address":" 德国 / 美国","years":"2021","date":"2021-10-29(美国网络)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704530428.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704525790.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704530423.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704530928.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704530599.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2704531912.webp\",\"https